Package: automation-toolbox
Version: 0.3.1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Automation Toolbox Team <noreply@localhost>
Depends: python3-gi, libgtk-3-0t64, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, gir1.2-webkit2-4.1
Description: Local automation toolbox with DINOv3 data cleaning
 A desktop toolbox with a separated FastAPI backend and React frontend.
 It includes DINOv3 similar-frame cleaning, media and dataset utilities,
 parallel execution, progress visualization, pause, retry, and cancellation.
